---
// RecentWorkGallery.astro - Masonry-style gallery of real jobs with explicit dimensions
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200 overflow-hidden font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-amber-200">
        <span>📸</span>
        <span>Real Jobs &bull; Real Expertise</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black font-heading text-[#0f274a] tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase">
        Don't Trust Stock Photos. <br />
        <span class="text-amber-500">See Our Real Work.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Many "locksmiths" online are out-of-state dispatch centers using fake stock images. We are a real, local Nashville team. Browse our recent high-end automotive, commercial, and residential jobs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Masonry Grid Layout -->
    <div class="columns-1 sm:columns-2 lg:columns-3 gap-6 space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Item 1: Detex Commercial Exit Control Lock (New Authentic Job) -->
      <a href="/commercial-locksmith/" class="block break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-slate-200 bg-white group relative cursor-pointer">
        <picture>
          <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/detex-commercial-lock-installation-nashville-600.webp 600w, /images/detex-commercial-lock-installation-nashville-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 50vw, 33vw" />
          <img src="/images/detex-commercial-lock-installation-nashville.jpg" alt="Armstrong Locksmith installing Detex commercial emergency exit alarm lock in Nashville TN" class="w-full h-auto object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="800" />
        </picture>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0f274a] via-[#0f274a]/90 to-transparent p-5 pt-16">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Commercial Security</span>
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base">Detex Commercial Emergency Exit Alarm Lock</h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-bold mt-2 flex items-center gap-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-y-0">View Commercial Locksmith &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Item 2: Maserati -->
      <a href="/european-car-key-specialist/" class="block break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-slate-200 bg-white group relative cursor-pointer">
        <picture>
          <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/Maserati-key-cut-and-programmed--scaled-600.webp 600w, /images/Maserati-key-cut-and-programmed--scaled-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 50vw, 33vw" />
          <img src="/images/Maserati-key-cut-and-programmed--scaled.jpg" alt="Maserati Smart Key Programming" class="w-full h-auto object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="450" />
        </picture>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0f274a] via-[#0f274a]/90 to-transparent p-5 pt-16">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Automotive</span>
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base">Maserati Proximity Smart Key</h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-bold mt-2 flex items-center gap-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-y-0">View Service &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Item 2: Commercial Keypad -->
      <a href="/commercial-locksmith/" class="block break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-slate-200 bg-white group relative cursor-pointer">
